Make rpi_camera_ipa.h usable from C.

The header declares an extern "C" API but names the handle type as plain
RpiIpaHandle_t after only "struct RpiIpaHandle_t;", which is valid C++ but
an unknown type name in C. Typedef it.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific (the qnx-ports public header)

--- a/src/ipa/rpi/qnx/public/include/rpi_camera_ipa.h
+++ b/src/ipa/rpi/qnx/public/include/rpi_camera_ipa.h
@@ -23,8 +23,8 @@
     RPI5,
 } rpiPlatform_t;
 
-// Forward declaration
-struct RpiIpaHandle_t;
+// Forward declaration (the typedef makes the header usable from C too)
+typedef struct RpiIpaHandle_t RpiIpaHandle_t;
 
 /**
  * @brief Start the image processing algorithm library
